---
// ZONE 4 — The Abyss. One glowing lure: the contact.
---
<section id="abyss" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-abyss-950">
  <div
    class="absolute top-20 left-1/4 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-glow-500/[0.05] blur-[120px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute right-1/5 bottom-32 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-glow-400/[0.05] blur-[130px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-32 text-center md:py-48">
    <p class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-glow-300/60 uppercase">
      &minus;4,000 m &middot; The Abyss
    </p>
    <h2
      class="reveal mt-6 font-display text-4xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight text-foam-50 md:text-6xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
    >
      You&rsquo;ve reached<br />the <em class="font-light text-glow-300">bottom.</em>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-foam-100/55"
      style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
    >
      Every descent ends somewhere. If you have a project to build, infrastructure to tame, or
      just want to talk shop &mdash; follow the light.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-12" style="--reveal-delay: 260ms">
      <a
        href="mailto:supianidz@octopy.dev"
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-glow-400 px-8 py-4 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-abyss-950 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <span
          class="lure-halo absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-glow-400/50 blur-2xl"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-envelope relative text-xl"></i>
        <span class="relative">supianidz@octopy.dev</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-12 flex items-center justify-center gap-4"
      style="--reveal-delay: 340ms"
    >
      <a
        href="https://github.com/supianidz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="GitHub"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/12 text-foam-100/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-glow-400/50 hover:text-glow-300"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-github-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/supianidz"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="LinkedIn"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/12 text-foam-100/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-glow-400/50 hover:text-glow-300"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-linkedin-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/628159826697?text=Hello%20Supian%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project."
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="WhatsApp"
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/12 text-foam-100/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-glow-400/50 hover:text-glow-300"
      >
        <i class="ph-duotone ph-whatsapp-logo text-2xl"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-white/10">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-white/35 sm:flex-row"
    >
      <span>&copy; 2026 Octopy &middot; Supian M. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span>Designed &amp; built by hand &middot; No cookies, no trackers</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</section>
